1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,202
In this video you will learn how to get started with NTSOne. Create your account, sign
in, find your way around the dashboard, and manage your settings.

2
00:00:11,802 --> 00:00:26,065
Start on the NTSOne home page. It shows everything the platform can do, from
registrations and voting to orders, payments and bookkeeping. To begin, choose Get
started or Create your account.

3
00:00:26,665 --> 00:00:46,456
Enter your organization's name, your name, your email address, and a strong password,
then agree to the terms and press Create account. We email you a six character code.
Enter it to confirm your email address, and your workspace is ready. You can also sign
up with Google.

4
00:00:47,056 --> 00:00:57,909
Next time, sign in with your email and password. If you forget your password, choose
Forgot password, and we will email you a link to choose a new one.

5
00:00:58,509 --> 00:01:13,106
After you sign in, you land on your dashboard. It summarizes your programs and
registrations, then your voting polls, your businesses, your payments, and your books,
so you can see how everything is going at a glance.

6
00:01:13,706 --> 00:01:27,103
The menu on the left takes you to each part of NTSOne: Programs, Voting Polls,
Businesses, your Wish List, Contributions, Users, your Payment fund, and Settings.

7
00:01:27,703 --> 00:01:38,331
Use the moon button at the top to switch between light and dark mode. The round button
with your initials opens your profile menu, where you can open Settings or log out.

8
00:01:38,931 --> 00:01:51,573
In Settings you can change your name and photo, your organization's name, your email
address and your password. Any other organizations you belong to are listed there,
with a button to leave them.

9
00:01:52,173 --> 00:02:06,485
At the bottom of Settings you can delete your account. You need your password, and you
must type the word DELETE. If you are the only person in your organization, its data
is deleted too, so this cannot be undone.

10
00:02:07,085 --> 00:02:17,527
If you need help, use the Contact page, or the Send feedback button inside the app.
You can also report a concern from the footer of any public page.

11
00:02:18,127 --> 00:02:27,070
That is how to get started with NTSOne. Use this video as your guide, and watch the
next videos to learn each part in detail.
